      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>求给定区间 [<span class=\"katex math inline\">X</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">Y</span>] 中满足下列条件的整数个数：这个数恰好等于 <span class=\"katex math inline\">K</span> 个互不相等的 <span class=\"katex math inline\">B</span> 的整数次幂之和。例如，设 <span class=\"katex math inline\">X=15</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">Y=20</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">K=2</span>,<span class=\"katex math inline\">B=2</span>，则有且仅有下列三个数满足题意：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">17</span>=<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span></sup>+<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">0</span></sup></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">18</span>=<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span></sup>+<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">1</span></sup></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex math inline\">20</span>=<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">4</span></sup>+<span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span><sup><span class=\"katex math inline\">2</span></sup></p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "求给定区间 [X,Y] 中满足下列条件的整数个数：这个数恰好等于 K 个互不相等的 B 的整数次幂之和。例如，设 X=15,Y=20,K=2,B=2，则有且仅有下列三个数满足题意：\n17=24+20\n18=24+21\n20=24+22"
    },
    {
